  "description": "Advanced HTTP request analysis for device detection, browser identification, and geolocation services in ASP.NET Core applications. Provides comprehensive user agent parsing to detect device types (mobile, tablet, desktop), operating systems, browser versions, and bot detection. Includes IP-based geolocation with country, city, timezone detection using MaxMind GeoIP2 database. Features crawler/bot identification, proxy detection, and detailed request information extraction.",
